    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages the ROOT GUI application for FCCVisualization. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1gui_1_1GuiApplication" kindref="compound">GuiApplication</ref> owns the ROOT <computeroutput>TApplication</computeroutput> instance responsible for managing the graphical application&apos;s event loop.</para>
<para>The application operates on an existing <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1Session" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::Session</ref>, which is referenced rather than owned by the GUI application. The lifetime of the Session must therefore extend beyond the lifetime of the <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1gui_1_1GuiApplication" kindref="compound">GuiApplication</ref>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1Session" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::Session</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>TApplication </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
